  "details": "Video related to the issue: \nhttps://youtu.be/m_-MvoCnlOQ\nClient Version: 1192 1 w_2022.1.2p3-a925a2b3f8 \nSDK version: 2022.04.26.15.46\nOS: Windows 10\nPlatform: Steam\nHeadset: Valve Index\nUnitypackage (includes sdk3): \nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1OVR6N20L7JtULpXJx8ATrdCMAkMqe4oo/view?usp=sharing\n \nAfter the Phys bone update, avatar with two or more stations causes the IK to break for other players.\nLocally everything appears to be working.\nI used an other account in desktop mode on the same system to see myself using VR.\nThis doesn't happen when the player with 2 or more stations is in desktop mode.",
